+ * Exynos UFS (Pixel 6a, ADT /sweet-ufs "exynos" = 1), as in Linux ufs-exynos.c:
+ * UTRD response/PRDT offsets and lengths in bytes (PRDT_BYTE_GRAN), PRDT
+ * segments of at most 4 KiB, PRDT entries of "prdt-entry-size" bytes (16, or
+ * 32 with the Flash Memory Protector format), UTRLCLR clears with 1 bits,
+ * 36-bit DMA instead of the 64AS capability. The LUN comes from the ADT "lun"
+ * or boot-arg ufslun=; without ufslun= LUNs 0-7 are searched for the
